if FUSIV

config FUSIV_BRINGUP
	bool "Debugging aids for testing images from RAM"
	help
	  Aids for testing a kernel that the bootloader EVA started from RAM,
	  on a box without a serial console:

	  - a log of the kernel messages in RAM, which survives a software
	    reset and which tools/fusiv-ramlog.c reads afterwards,
	  - LEDs and the AVM reboot status text that show how far the boot
	    got,
	  - the image that EVA left in RAM as the MTD partitions kernel_ram
	    and rootfs_ram, so that a flash image can be tested from RAM.

	  They are not needed to run an image from flash.

endif
